// A classical visual-novel intro: stage directions via [#tags],
// choices, conditions and mutations on GameState.
using GameState

~ start
The afternoon light pools between the desks. Somewhere, a chalk tap-taps against the board. [#bg=classroom, #sprite=none:left, #sprite=none:right, #show=shadow@far_right, #music=calm]
Rook: Another transfer student. Just what this school needed. [#sprite=rook:right, #focus=right, #voice=r1]
Maya: H-hey! The bell hasn't even rung yet, I'm not late! [#sprite=maya_surprised:left, #focus=left, #voice=m1]
Rook: The bell rang four minutes ago. [#focus=right, #voice=r2]
Maya: ... [#sprite=maya_smile:left]
Maya: Fine, you win, clock-watch person. I'm Maya. And you are? [#voice=m2]
(Write your name in the class register.) [#input=player_name?placeholder=Your name&default=Alex&max=16]
Maya: {{player_name}}, huh. Suits you. [#sprite=maya_smile:left]
- I'm Alex. Nice to meet you.
	Maya: {{player_name}}! That's a solid name. I'm Maya! [#sprite=maya_smile:left, #voice=m3]
	do met_maya = true
- I'd rather not say.
	Maya: Ooh, the mysterious type. I'm Maya. I'll find out eventually. [#sprite=maya:left, #voice=m4]
	do met_maya = true
- (Stay silent)
	Maya: ...You're fun to tease. I'm Maya. [#sprite=maya:left, #voice=m5]
	do met_maya = true
Rook: Enjoy the rooftop if you like. Everyone ends up there eventually. [#sprite=rook:right, #focus=right, #voice=r3]
do met_rook = true
if day == 1:
	The first bell of the day finally rings, [color=#9fd8ff]sharp and bright[/color]. [#sfx=confirm]
else:
	Another day at {{school_name}}. The halls already hum with gossip.
=> rooftop

~ rooftop
Wind over the chain-link fence. The city glitters below like scattered coins. [#bg=rooftop, #sprite=none:left, #sprite=none:right, #music=warm]
Maya: See? Told you the view was worth the stairs. [#sprite=maya_smile:left, #focus=left, #voice=m6]
Rook: You brought a witness to my hiding spot. Unforgivable. [#sprite=rook_surprised:right, #focus=right, #voice=r4]
- Ask what Rook hides up here.
	Rook: Quiet. It's the only currency this school respects. [#voice=r5, #music=tense]
	do knows_secret = true
- Ask Maya why she's so kind.
	Maya: Kind? I just collect interesting people. You're exhibit A. [#sprite=maya_smile:left, #voice=m7]
- (Say nothing. Watch the sunset.)
	[speed=0.5]The sun goes down slow, and for once, nobody says a word.[/speed]
Maya: Same time tomorrow? [#sprite=maya:left, #voice=m8]
Rook: ...Hmph. Don't be late. [#sprite=rook_smile:right, #voice=r6]
[#show=shadow@far_right]
Maya: (nudges) There's someone else up here. [#sprite=maya_surprised:left, #focus=left]
Rook: Always was. This roof is louder than the bell. [#sprite=rook:right, #focus=right]
The three of you watch until the sky burns out. [#hide=shadow?t=0.6, #box=hide, #music=loop:night]
- Head home for the night.
	=> END
- Take one last look at the classroom.
	=> classroom_3d

~ classroom_3d
The door swings open on an empty classroom. [#box=show, #stage=classroom, #show=maya@door, #show=shadow@window, #music=warm]
Maya: We really did skip the last bell. [#move=maya@desk?t=0.9, #anim=maya:wave]
Rook: I saw. From here. [#show=rook@guest_desk, #focus=rook]
Maya: (whispering) ...someone by the window. [#show=maya:surprised, #focus=maya]
Rook: A memory. Ignore them. [#show=rook:sad, #focus=rook]
Maya: Guess we all needed the quiet. [#show=maya:smile, #focus=maya]
Rook: Don't ruin it by saying so. [#show=rook:smile]
[#hide=maya@hall?t=0.6, #hide=rook@hall?t=0.6, #hide=shadow?t=0.6]
The empty room keeps their voices for a moment more, then lets them go. [#stage=2d, #bg=rooftop]
=> END
